    "common.cancel" : {
      "comment" : "Button of a confirmation in Storage settings that changes nothing.\nButton of a jump panel (Go to Percent, Time or Page) that closes it without jumping.\nButton of the Edit Text explanation alert that stops without opening the editor. Escape presses it.\nButton of the book information sheet that closes it without saving.\nButton of the sheet that shows the library being moved: cancels the move.\nButton that closes a question and changes nothing.\nButton that closes a sheet or answers a question without doing or changing anything.\nButton that closes a sheet or dialog without doing what it offered.\nButton that closes a sheet or dialog without making its change.\nButton that closes an alert or stops waiting, in the reader.\nButton that leaves a sheet, panel, or question without making its change, such as the panel for adding a bookmark or editing its note.\nText of the Library tab of Settings, a list of the views the Library window offers (built-in views and the listener's own). The button of either question that changes nothing.\nText of the Library view editor sheet, which makes and changes a view of the Library window, and of the descriptions of a view's filter. The button that closes the sheet, changing nothing.\nThe button in the Export dialog that closes it without exporting.\nTitle and VoiceOver label of the Cancel button of the duplicate-book question.\nTitle of a button that cancels, in the Substitutions settings' question and rule editor.\nTitle of the Cancel button of the Add to Library sheet, which closes it.\nTitle of the button that cancels the removal of the duplicate books selected, in its confirmation.\nTitle of the feed downloads section's button that stops the feed downloads.\nTitle of the question's button that keeps the Record window open; it answers the Escape key.",
