    "common.close" : {
      "comment" : "Button that closes a reader view or sheet.\nButton that closes a sheet or window and returns to what is under it, such as the sleep timer sheet over a book's reader, a feed's information sheet, or the reader's own sheets.\nButton that closes a sheet, such as the audio editor's list of markers.\nButton that closes a sheet, such as the sleep timer sheet over a book's reader.\nButton that closes a sheet.\nName of the File menu's Close command, which closes the window, in a sentence saying why a keyboard shortcut cannot take its key.\nThe button in the Export dialog that closes it after an export that did not do everything asked.\nTitle of the button that closes a sheet, such as the speech refusal report.\nTitle of the button that closes the Search Library window.",
