    "common.stop" : {
      "comment" : "A choice of the Reading List's When a book ends pop-up button: when a book opened from the list ends, stop there.\nA choice of the When a Book Ends picker: the book stops at its end, finished. Play then says it is finished.\nA choice of the pop-up button that sets what happens when an item ends: stop when it ends.\nButton of the Compare Libraries sheet that stops the comparison.\nName of a key of the keyboard, spoken by VoiceOver and shown in braille in a keyboard shortcut such as \"Command + Stop\".\nName of a keyboard shortcut action, listed in Settings in the Record window group and read by VoiceOver. Stops the recording.\nName of a keyboard shortcut action, listed in Settings in the audio editor group and read by VoiceOver. Stops playback in the audio editor.\nThe button in the Export dialog that stops an export under way.\nTitle of the button in the Record window that stops recording and saves it.\nTitle of the button that stops a running search in the Search Library window.",
