    "common.useTheGlobalSettingValue" : {
      "comment" : "A choice of the Open the next book in pop-up button in Feed Info and Folder Settings: do as Settings says. %@ is the name of the choice Settings has now, such as This Window.\nA choice of the pop-up button that sets what happens when an item ends, in Feed Info and Folder Settings: do as Settings says. %@ is the name of the choice Settings has now, such as Continue to Next Book.\nThe first choice of the Audio Info pop-up for a book's original audio: follow the global setting. %@ is that setting's name, such as \"Keep\".\nTitle of the checkbox that makes a feed follow the global setting. %@ is the global setting's value, such as \"Every item listed, newest 5 downloaded\".",
