    "common.valueColonValue" : {
      "comment" : "A label and its value on one line, such as \"Elapsed: 1:04\". %1$@ is the label and %2$@ its value. English puts a colon and a space between them.\nA label, a colon, and its value, as one line of the audio editor's sheets and the filter presets. %1$@ is the label and %2$@ the value.\nA name, a colon, and its value, such as a keyboard shortcut action's name and its keys, or a control's label and its value. %1$@ is the name and %2$@ is the value.\nThe name of a keyboard shortcut action with the name of its group before it, such as an audio editor action. %1$@ is the group's name and %2$@ the action's own name.\nTitle of a reader window for a book whose author is unknown. %1$@ is the word that begins it (\"Book\" or \"Reading List\"); %2$@ is the book's title.\nTitle of the reader's sheet for a book's own settings. %1$@ is the sheet's name, \"Audio Settings\" or \"Voice & Speed\"; %2$@ is the book's title.\nWhat VoiceOver says for a detail of Book Information. %1$@ is the detail's label; %2$@ is its value.",
      "extractionState" : "manual",
