    "common.valueCountOfCount" : {
      "comment" : "A question's title, a comma, then its place among the questions waiting. %1$@ is the title, %2$lld the question's place and %3$lld the number of questions, such as \"Duplicate Book Found, 2 of 3\".\nText of the Library tab of Settings, a list of the views the Library window offers (built-in views and the listener's own). What VoiceOver says after a move: the view and its new place, \"Reading List, 4 of 6\", short enough to hear after each of many moves. Placeholders in order: name, number, count.\nVoiceOver announcement after a book moved one place in an order the user arranges. %1$@ is the book's title. %2$lld is its new place, counted from 1. %3$lld is how many books the order holds.",
