    "common.valueOfValue" : {
      "comment" : "How many bytes of an archive's declared total have been extracted. %1$@ is the size done and %2$@ the total size, each with its unit, such as \"1.2 GB of 3.4 GB\".\nThe audio editor's time display as VoiceOver speaks it. %1$@ is the cursor's time and %2$@ the audio's length, both in words such as \"12 minutes, 4.3 seconds\".\nThe audio editor's time display as shown and brailled. %1$@ is the cursor's time and %2$@ the audio's length, both as clock times such as \"12:04.3\".",
