    "phoneReader.sleepTimerAdjustHint" : {
      "comment" : "Last sentence of the hint of the iPhone reader's Sleep Timer button, an adjustable control: adjusting it up (VoiceOver's swipe up) starts the running timer again from its whole length, down cancels it. Names no gesture.",
