    "speechRefusal.chapter" : {
      "comment" : "A line of the speech refusal report naming the chapter speech stopped in. %1$@ is the chapter's number counting from 1, %2$@ the number of chapters, and %3$@ the chapter's number counting from 0 as the debug log writes it, each written without digit grouping. Keep \"chapter=\" as it is: it is the log's own tag.",
